{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：07:02 2026-10-16 HKT<br/>發佈時間：07:02 2026-10-16 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：07:02 2026-10-16 HKT</p><img alt=\"蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b0933cf2316ed31dcfc60037ca56d5d1/2026-10/30_3.jpeg\"/><p>一股清勁的偏東氣流正影響廣東沿岸。</p><p>本港地區今日部分時間有陽光，日間最高氣溫約30度。晚上有一兩陣微雨。吹和緩東風，風勢間中清勁。</p><img alt=\"本港地區今日部分時間有陽光，日間最高氣溫約30度。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/4c2ebd622cbc3ab5720745da31cc490c/2026-10/32_1.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/30ca8ce3601ee49ce02a5c7cdd83a8cd/2026-10/2026-10-15_23_59_29.png\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/fb41cfb60ca1ab4777fa2d4cb8b1971e/2026-10/2026-10-16_00_03_15.png\"/><img alt=\"本港地區今日部分時間有陽光，日間最高氣溫約30度。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/a804136730e6f7e19bf434f565354325/2026-10/33_3.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"本港地區今日部分時間有陽光，日間最高氣溫約30度。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/660675556b81435ca5a7e0135440a411/2026-10/31_2.jpeg\"/><p>展望明日有一兩陣雨。重陽節初時雲量仍然較多，稍後至下週初漸轉天晴乾燥。下週中期日間炎熱。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T01:44:54.141620+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":193,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T23:02:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T02:37:51.115014+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T01:38:46.083823+00:00","content_hash":"d4bbbe96bb3890b14abf1ed05b0b5faeec177ad536902006a7252784f05ded45","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}